        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-20" value="Introdução" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="332" y="394" width="519" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-21" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="330" y="426" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1068" y="426" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-22" value="O objetivo principal desta API é &lt;b&gt;suportar a recuperação de domínios variados da Sotreq&lt;/b&gt;. Em sua versão atual (v1.0.0), a API foca em uma funcionalidade específica: consultar e listar os &lt;b&gt;Centros de Custo&lt;/b&gt; associados a uma determinada empresa." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="332" y="437" width="752" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-23" value="Ambientes disponíveis" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="323" y="896" width="519" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-24" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="321" y="928" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1059" y="928" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-25" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sandbox:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;https://dev-api.sotreq.com.br/sb/dominios/v1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Homologação:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(237, 237, 237)); background-color: transparent; font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;https://hml-api.sotreq.com.br/dominios/v1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Produção:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;https://api.sotreq.com.br/dominios/v1&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#999900;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="296" y="929" width="600.5" height="108" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-26" value="Autenticação" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="323" y="1071" width="519" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-27" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="321" y="1103" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1059" y="1103" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-28" value="&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Todas as requisições para a API devem ser autenticadas. A autenticação é feita através do envio de duas informações no cabeçalho (header) de cada chamada:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;client_id&lt;/code&gt;: O identificador único do seu aplicativo, cadastrado no portal.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;access_token&lt;/code&gt;: O token de acesso para autorizar a requisição.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;Sem esses cabeçalhos, a API retornará um erro &lt;code&gt;401 Unauthorized&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Caso tenha alguma duvida sobre o fluxo de autenticação, favor acessar página de&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#999900;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="301" y="1121.42" width="772" height="135" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-29" value="Funcionalidades" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontStyle=1;fontSize=15;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="331" y="503" width="519" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-30" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;rounded=0;" parent="i765M6m-gPjQ1ThkUvTD-0" edge="1">
